<!-- The Halo 3-style multiplayer screens (Menu style Halo 3): the lobby stands for the Xbox's
Multiplayer screen (ui\shell\main_menu\multiplayer_type_select\multiplayer_type_select_screen), as
OpenCE's multiplayer.xml does with Menu style Halo CE, and opens the same flows with the same
functions (menu_functions.c "port mp/browser/setup/code ..."): laid out as Halo 3's custom games
lobby - MULTIPLAYER LOBBY's column at the left (NETWORK, GAME, MAP, START GAME, EDIT GAME TYPES,
BROWSE GAMES, JOIN WITH CODE, Ready, the map's picture and "<game> on <map>"), the players at the
right, the buttons in the column's foot. NETWORK, GAME and MAP open pickers as Halo 3's Select Map;
BROWSE GAMES the server browser in Halo 3's style (VITA and PC badges, the orange bar), START GAME
on ONLINE Create Game. The map pictures and descriptions are ui.map's own; the rest this folder's
art (tools/halo3_menu_art.py). -->
