	<!-- the lobby: NETWORK, GAME and MAP open their pickers; START GAME hosts as the network says
	(ONLINE: Create Game; SYSTEM LINK: the System Link screen's profile, then the new game's map
	list, as its Y; OFFLINE: split screen's), as do BROWSE GAMES (ONLINE: the server browser;
	SYSTEM LINK: the System Link list) - the rows of the other networks hidden (port h3 mp lobby);
	EDIT GAME TYPES the Xbox's own; ONLINE's rows need internet play, else the screen saying how
	to turn it on -->
